      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Li Li, do you have some free time tomorrow evening?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "李力：有空。怎么了？",
      "traditional": "李力：有空。怎麼了？",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lì yǒu kòng zěn me le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Li: Yes I have time. What’s up?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "安妮：明天是我的生日，我想和朋友们一起聚一聚。",
      "traditional": "安妮：明天是我的生日，我想和朋友們一起聚一聚。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī míng tiān shì wǒ de shēng rì wǒ xiǎng hé péng you men yì qǐ jù yi jù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Tomorrow is my birthday, I want to get together with friends."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "李力：哇！好啊。祝你生日快乐。",
      "traditional": "李力：哇！好啊。祝你生日快樂。",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lì wā hǎo a zhù nǐ shēng rì kuài lè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Li: Ahh that is great. Happy birthday."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "安妮：谢谢，可是我不知道要去哪里玩。你有什么好主意吗？",
      "traditional": "安妮：謝謝，可是我不知道要去哪裏玩。你有什麼好主意嗎？",
      "pinyin": "ān nī xiè xie kě shì wǒ bù zhī dào yào qù nǎ lǐ wán nǐ yǒu shén me hǎo zhǔ yi ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Thanks, but I don’t know where we should go. Do you have any good idea?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "李力：你去过KTV吗？",
